 "strings": {
  "What! Really?": "",
  "Yeah. I've been wanting to talk to you again.": "",
  "That's sweet <symbol=message_heart1><symbol=message_heart1>\nWhere should we meet then?": "",
  "Sorry. Now's not the best time.": "",
  "I see. You must be a busy guy... <symbol=message_sad1>": "",
  "Hey, it's Sana. Thank you for today. I really had a lot of fun! <symbol=message_joy1>": "",
  "I did too.": "",
  "Yeah, I'm totally beat.": "",
  "I did too. Let's go out again sometime.": "",
  "Yes please! I'm always available, so please let me know whenever you're free! <symbol=message_onpu>": "",
  "Don't go leaving me hanging now! <symbol=message_sad1>": "",
  "Huh? You mean I wore you out? <symbol=message_sad1>": "",
  "Oh, no, that's not what I meant.": "",
  "I'm sorry I made you feel tired! <symbol=message_sad1><symbol=message_sad1><symbol=message_sad1>": "",
  "That's... not the case at all. Don't worry.": "",
  "Guess what! This guy who came to my concert today? Apparently he came all the way from Kansai just to see me!": "",
  "Dang, he must really be a fan.": "",
  "I know, right!? <symbol=message_onpu>\nBut you know...": "",
  "I know what?": "",
  "I'd be even happier if you came to see! <symbol=message_happy1>": "",
  "I'll definitely be there next time.": "",
  "Really!?": "",
  "Yeah. I promise.": "",
  "I'll go as soon as I get the chance.": "",
  "Ah, that means you'll never show up.": "",
  "That's not true. Seriously, as soon as I'm free.": "",
  "Okay, I'll hold you to it!": "",
  "I'll be there next time for sure.": "",
  "I've got news for you, Yagami-san!": "",
  "What's the good word?": "",
  "So I met with someone from the agency... and they asked me if I want to sign with them. I'm about to make my debut! <symbol=message_onpu>": "",
  "Amazing!": "",
  "You're going to make so much money!": "",
  "No way! That's amazing!": "",
  "Right!? \n<symbol=message_joy1><symbol=message_joy1><symbol=message_joy1>": "",
  "You're going to make so much money! I'm jealous...": "",
  "Are you that broke?": "",
  "Anyway, the agency noticed my videos were trending!\nThey want me to sign before I decide to go with\nsomeone else lol": "",
  "Sounds like you're in high demand. Are you going to accept the offer?": "",
  "Of course! This is my moment after all <symbol=message_onpu>": "",
  "Things have been going so well ever since I met you, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Yagami-san. I went to my first professional recording session today. I was super nervous!": "",
  "Ooh, for your CD? When's it coming out?": "",
  "Next month! They're already advertising it online!": "",
  "Then let's meet up to celebrate.": "",
  "I'd like to celebrate, but...": "",
  "Congrats! Then we should celebrate together!": "",
  "Is that okay with you!?": "",
  "Absolutely. How about we meet out front of Kamuro Theater?": "",
  "Okay! See you there! <symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "Congrats! I want to go see you, but now's not such a good time.": "",
  "Oh. You wanna celebrate some other time then?": "",
  "Yup. I'll get in touch with you ASAP.": "",
  "Okay! I'll be looking forward to it! <symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "(Oh yeah, I gave her an outfit as a gift. Should I see if she'll wear it?)": "",
  "Ask if she'll wear it": "",
  "Her usual outfit is fine": "",
  "Hey, you know that outfit I gave you? I'd love to see you in it!": "",
  "Oh really? I'll wear it then!": "",
  "Cool. Can't wait to see you!": "",
  "(Nah, I don't wanna be that guy...)": "",
  "Sana here. Just wanted to thank you again for today <symbol=message_onpu>\nHope you enjoyed my curry <symbol=message_joy1>": "",
  "Make me some more next time.": "",
  "We should go out to eat next time.": "",
  "Then I guess I'm coming over to your place again <symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "As long as it's for you, I can make curry anytime.": "",
  "Are you saying... my curry wasn't any good?\n<symbol=message_sad1>": "",
  "That's not what I was trying to say.": "",
  "Is that so (-_-;)": "",
  "Do you remember Kabata-san? He's the one Kitamura-san was talking about the other day.": "",
  "Wasn't that the guy who was raising a big stink about us dating?": "",
  "That's the one. So he came to my live performance today, but it seems like he's still suspicious. About you and me.": "",
  "He needs to chill out.": "",
  "We must've looked like a good couple!": "",
  "This guy's annoying me.": "",
  "I can't believe he would go to such great lengths only to misunderstand us like this.": "",
  "Right? Although I don't necessarily mind being mistaken with you...": "",
  "Lol then we must've looked like a damn good couple!": "",
  "Oh my... (^///^)": "",
  "But seriously, it's annoying that he keeps thinking of us like that.": "",
  "You're... annoyed by that?": "",
  "...That kinda hurts my feelings (;_:)": "",
  "I didn't intend to hurt your feelings. Sorry.": "",
  "Anyway, let me know if Kabata-san causes any trouble. I'm sure you'll be just fine, though.": "",
  "Okay, will do!": "",
  "Yagami-san. Could we meet up again? There's something I need to tell you.": "",
  "Of course. Is something wrong?": "",
  "No... It's more like... I need to sort out how I feel. Are you free right now?": "",
  "Yeah, I am.": "",
  "Now's not a good time.": "",
  "Yeah, I am. Let's meet up at Theater Square then.": "",
  "Okay! I'm looking forward to it!": "",
  "Sorry. Now's not a good time. I'll catch you another time.": "",
  "Okay. Then I'll be waiting.": "",
  "Sana here! Just letting you know I had a wonderful time today. Hope you had as much fun as I did!": "",
  "Wish it would last forever.": "",
  "Yeah, it was chill.": "",
  "Yeah, I had fun.": "",
  "When I was with you... I found myself wishing time would stop for just the two of us.\nLol! I am being serious though.": "",
  "(o A o ;)": "",
  "Does that mean... (o///o)": "",
  "For sure. I'm starting to understand how you feel now.": "",
  "You're gonna make me blush... <symbol=message_happy1>": "",
  "So, I gotta know. Who's this guy you like, Sana-chan?": "",
  "Not telling <symbol=message_angry1>": "",
  "Oh... just chill, huh...": "",
  "Yeah, it was fun.": "",
  "Yay! <symbol=message_heart1> Thanks for letting me know.": "",
  "Hi Yagami-san! <symbol=message_onpu>\nWhat are you up to today?": "",
  "Working.": "",
  "Being bored.": "",
  "Thinking about you.": "",
  "Just working.": "",
  "Ooh, like what? Are you gonna go track down a suspect? You know, 'cause you're a detective and all.": "",
  "Well, I can't disclose too many details since I have to protect my clients' privacy... But generally, I do go out searching for people or investigating extramarital affairs.": "",
  "Sometimes I end up on cases that surprise even me.": "",
  "I see... Well, at least you'll never get bored!": "",
  "Nothing. Literally. I'm out of things to do. ": "",
  "O RLY? <symbol=message_joy1>": "",
  "Thinking about you, of course.": "",
  "What! Really!?": "",
  "Actually... I was thinking about you too! What a coincidence <symbol=message_heart1><symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "I guess great minds think alike.": "",
  "Actually... I lied.": "",
  "Hehe. I guess they do! <symbol=message_heart1><symbol=message_happy1><symbol=message_happy1><symbol=message_happy1><symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "Actually... I lied. I can't get my mind off work.": "",
  "(She's not replying. Am I messing around too much?)": "",
  "What are you up to, Sana-chan?": "",
  "I'm about to go meet with some agency staff. Apparently they want to discuss some things with me.": "",
  "Song-related things, I hope.": "",
  "I'm not sure. They just called to ask if I could come in and answer some questions.": "",
  "They sounded more serious than usual. So I'm not sure what to think... <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "Hopefully it's nothing too crazy.": "",
  "Do you have a moment, Yagami-san?": "",
  "I wanted to talk to you about my agency.": "",
  "Sure. I'll see you in front of Kamuro Theater then.": "",
  "Okay. Sorry I keep bothering you <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "Sorry. I gotta deal with this other thing...": "",
  "Oh, I see.": "",
  "I'll get in touch with you later.": "",
  "Okay, I'll be waiting <symbol=message_onpu>": "",
  "Sana here <symbol=message_onpu>\nThank you again for today <symbol=message_joy1>\nAre you hurt at all, Yagami-san? Do you feel any pain that won't go away? <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "I'm totally fine.": "",
  "My heart hurts.": "",
  "I'm totally fine. That sort of thing happens to me all the time.": "",
  "Is that so! <symbol=message_joy1>\nI didn't know you were so strong... I was actually kinda mesmerized <symbol=message_heart1><symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "My body is fine... It's my heart that hurts. Because I got so worried about you.": "",
  "That's... sweet of you <symbol=message_happy1>\nBut honestly, I'm okay! And it's all thanks to you!\n<symbol=message_joy1><symbol=message_joy1><symbol=message_joy1>": "",
  "Sounds like your agency gives you one problem after another, huh?": "",
  "It would seem so. Hope I don't collapse from all the pressure (-_-;;)": "",
  "Yagami-san, listen to this. It seems that Kabata-san had a change of heart. I was just notified that he sent my agency an apology letter.": "",
  "Huh, never saw that coming. That's good.": "",
  "Yes, but... the manager still won't let up. He says I need to be way more careful from now on. <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "Have you figured out your response to him?": "",
  "Yeah, thanks to you. After what happened, my mind is all made up.": "",
  "Love is a powerful force that does more than drive my music. It reflects the way I live, and I won't hide that for anyone.\nNot for my bosses, not even for my fans.\nOtherwise my songs would lose their meaning.": "",
  "I understand. Do be aware that your manager might not see eye to eye with you, though.": "",
  "Yes. That's why I plan on negotiating with him, as you mentioned before.": "",
  "With my newly completed song, that is.": "",
  "Ah, so it's ready at long last?": "",
  "Then I'll be cheering you on.": "",
  "I'd like to hear that sometime.": "",
  "Then I'll be cheering you on. I'm sure you'll manage to persuade him.": "",
  "Thank you! I'll do my very best! ": "",
  "Maybe after my manager hears it first, haha. Wish me luck!": "",
  "So I finally talked to my manager.": "",
  "And how'd it go?": "",
  "Well, as you can guess, he certainly wasn't too thrilled... at first.": "",
  "But then I showed him my new song, and wow! He fell in love with it instantly. Like, he was totally floored!": "",
  "Nice!": "",
  "And you know what else he said? That it would be a shame if the no-dating policy was gonna stifle my creativity. ": "",
  "So he told me he'd negotiate with the president of the company! Isn't that great!?<symbol=message_happy1>": "",
  "Yeah, that's incredible!": "",
  "Here's hoping everything goes smoothly.": "",
  "May I hear that song of yours now?": "",
  "Thank you! I'll do everything I can on my part!": "",
  "Lol maybe next time!": "",
  "Yagami-san. When's the next time you're free? There's something I need to confess.": "",
  "Whenever's good for you.": "",
  "We can meet up whenever's good for you.": "",
  "Then, would it be okay if I head over tonight?": "",
  "That's fine. Should I just wait at the office then?": "",
  "Yes please!": "",
  "Sorry, I'm busy with something else.": "",
  "Oh, okay. When would you be able to meet?": "",
  "As soon as I possibly can.": "",
  "Got it. I'll be waiting for your message then.": "",
  "Yagami-san, did you know there are some videos of me online?": "",
  "Well, I do now! Did you upload those yourself?": "",
  "Yes, I have been. Even before I came to Kamurocho, I would upload videos here and there in hopes that more people would hear my music.": "",
  "Dang, I had no idea. And you're still doing that now?": "",
  "Well, I kinda stopped ever since I moved into town...": "",
  "But the older stuff has been getting a lot of hits lately. Big enough for a talent agent to contact me...\nThey said they wanted to meet up in person <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "I expected nothing less of you.": "",
  "That's good, but I'm a little worried.": "",
  "Amazing. I expected nothing less of you, Sana-chan.": "",
  "Oh please, it's no big deal! :3": "",
  "I'm glad you're finally coming up in the music scene, but still... I get worried sometimes.": "",
  "Aww, you're actually worried about me? That's so cute! <symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "Well, I've heard good things about this place, so I don't think last time is gonna repeat itself.\nI am a little nervous though ^^;": "",
  "What makes you so nervous?": "",
  "Why not give them a chance?": "",
  "I feel you.": "",
  "What makes you so nervous? Are you getting weird vibes or something?": "",
  "It's kinda hard to put into words <symbol=message_heart2>": "",
  "Why not give them a chance? The least you could do is hear them out, and if you don't like what they're selling, beat it.": "",
  "You're right. It's not like this sorta thing happens every day.": "",
  "I understand, given everything you suffered through already...": "",
  "Even so... I still wanna give 'em a try. Hope it goes well <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "Thanks for coming out today, Sana-chan. Let's hang out again soon.": "",
  "I'd love to! Just let me know whenever you're free <symbol=message_onpu>": "",
  "(She didn't seem too into our last date. Maybe I should send her a text.)": "",
  "Sana-chan, about that invitation. I'm actually free right now.": "",
  "Really!? Me too <symbol=message_happy1>": "",
  "All right, then. Meet you at Theater Square?": "",
  "Okay! Be there in a heartbeat <symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "(Let's see if she's down to go out somewhere.)": "",
  "Cool, can't wait to see you!": "",
  "Cops're heading your way.": "",
  "Finish what you gotta do, quick.": "",
  "Yosuke Saotome here. I need to discuss something with you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Don't tell me there's another pervert out there...": "",
  "Don't tell me Tsukino-san's being harassed again...": "",
  "No, no. That's not it. Or at least... I don't think so...": "",
  "You don't think so?": "",
  "Well, it's just that Tsukino-san seems depressed lately. It worries me. And the worst thing is, she won't say a word to me.": "",
  "That is worrying.": "",
  "Yeah. But I think she might open up to you.": "",
  "Are you saying she trusts me more than she trusts you?": "",
  "Oh? Why's that?": "",
  "Of course. Who'd trust a blabbermouth like me?": "",
  "Ah. I see. But why me of all people?": "",
  "I think some things are just hard to talk about with family. Plus, she respects you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "To be honest, I think she kinda has a thing for you.": "",
  "Huh? Really...?": "",
  "At least that's my hunch as her brother.": "",
  "So, I'm sorry to ask you this, but could you try contacting her?": "",
  "Okay. Will do.": "",
  "(Looks like it's up to me to find out what's bothering Tsukino-chan. I'll get in touch with her soon.)": "",
  "Hey, its been awhile. This is Yagami, by the way.": "",
  "Oh, hey! Nice to hear from you! <symbol=message_joy2> Can I help you with something?": "",
  "I heard you were feeling a little down.": "",
  "Just checking in on you.": "",
  "Do you think we could meet up?": "",
  "Well, I heard from your brother that you've been feeling a little down.": "",
  "Just checking in on you. Is everything okay?": "",
  "Yeah, everything's totally fine! <symbol=message_joy2> Why?": "",
  "Yeah, do you think we could meet up?": "",
  "Why, what's going on? Did something happen!?": "",
  "He said that to you?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
